<title>SWITZERLAND: Top 30 ACI Airports Cargo Volume May 97.</title>
<headline>Top 30 ACI Airports Cargo Volume May 97.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Los Angeles again closed its gap behing Memphis in the listings of the world's busiest cargo airports prepared by the Geneva based Airports Council (ACI).</p>
<p>But Memphis home of Fedex mainained its top listing with a 2.6 percent gain to 178,307 tonnes compared to May 1996.</p>
<p>The May 1997 rankings (May '96) of the  world's 30 busiest cargo airports, with volume in tonnes and percentage change from May 1996,were:</p>
<p>  rank   Airport	     Tonnage   Percent change</p>
<p>  1 (1)  Memphis	     178,307   up     2.6</p>
<p>  2 (2)  Los Angeles	 157,155   up     9.6</p>
<p>  3 (5)  Hong Kong	   148,693   up    13.2</p>
<p>  4 (3)  Miami		 148,630   up     6.7</p>
<p>  5 (6)  Tokyo-Narita	137,726   up     9.0</p>
<p>  6 (4)  New York/JFK	136,073   up     1.5</p>
<p>  7 (9)  Seoul		 126,253   up    13.3</p>
<p>  8 (7)  Frankfurt	   119,429   down   1.4</p>
<p>  9 (8)  Louisville	  114,860   down   0.8</p>
<p> 10 (10) Chicago	     112,657   up     7.4</p>
<p> 11 (12) Singapore	   112,563   up    14.3</p>
<p> 12 (11) Anchorage	   112,258   up    10.3</p>
<p> 13 (13) London Heathrow   103,510   up     7.5</p>
<p> 14 (14) Amsterdam	   101,235   up    12.7</p>
<p> 15 (15) Newark		 87,011   up     1.7</p>
<p> 16 (16) Paris		  82,925   up     9.0</p>
<p> 17 (20) Taipei		 76,182   up    15.6</p>
<p> 18 (17) Atlanta		70,722   up     1.8</p>
<p> 19 (18) Dallas/Fort Worth  69,109   up     2.7</p>
<p> 20 (-)  San Francisco	67,587   up    12.4</p>
<p> 21.(19) Dayton		 65,873   down   0.5</p>
<p> 22 (-)  Bangkok		65,644   up     4.8</p>
<p> 23 (-)  Oakland		55,449   up     1.5</p>
<p> 24 (-)  Tokyo		  52,343   up     3.5</p>
<p> 25 (-)  Indianapolis	 50,821   down   8.2</p>
<p> 26 (-)  Philadelphia	 50,251   up    13.8</p>
<p> 27 (-)  Toledo		 42,762   up    41.9</p>
<p> 28 (-)  Brussels	     41,945   up    11.6</p>
<p> 29 (-)  Manila		 40,009   up    42.4</p>
<p> 30 (-)  Ontario		36,023   up    13.9</p>
<p>* includes freight and mail in transit as well as loaded/unloaded. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
